{"agent":"fix-be5e","data":{"item":"","repro":{"bytes":4903,"mode":"full","ref":"sha256:b379f3557cfd2792189258cc34a3588b6cbeae2f704f5b2fd2789c46cdfe2523","truncated":false},"severity":"low","summary":"Claiming fix-Be5e7dc7e27 warned: 'tests/test_upgrade_dry_run.py does not exist, but a file named like it does; nearest: ...'. The file had been split; the message should say the glob is stale after a split and name the exact `ddflow update <id> --globs` call with the likely replacements, rather than implying a typo.","title":"claim glob warning for a split-away file says a file 'named like it' exists and lists look-alikes, hiding that the item's globs are stale"},"id":"e224dc822b317e3a048e953d3","kind":"bug.found","lamport":126394,"schema":1,"subject":"B-claim-stale-glob-warning-wording","ts":"2026-11-02T05:47:24.856210Z"}
{"agent":"fix-be5e","data":{"item":"","repro":{"bytes":4933,"mode":"full","ref":"sha256:3de5263cf077ea4c8c3a4894213a23aa4dcd3f798bfe764630682529a8928243","truncated":false},"severity":"low","summary":"While `ddflow gate run <id> ci` ran about 30 minutes, heartbeats returned yield_requested for SZ-split-demo_scenario_full_lifecycle ('no progress for 17m, commit, narrow globs or release'). A running gate is progress; the idle clock should reset while a gate run is live, or the message should say a gate run is in flight so the waiter does not ask a working agent to yield.","title":"a 30-minute ci gate run counts as 'no progress' and triggers a yield request from a waiting task"},"id":"e3016aa70f030052245d4e996","kind":"bug.found","lamport":126396,"schema":1,"subject":"B-long-ci-run-holds-globs-while-waiter-asks-yield","ts":"2026-11-02T05:47:33.241420Z"}
